      "inherited_baseline_and_constraints": "The DRC starts from extremely weak state capacity, pervasive corruption risk, and active security conflict. That means some visible output is meaningful, but the bar for strong effectiveness is much higher and the record must show more than plans and meetings.",
      "ruler_attribution": "Some direct chairmanship and budget instructions are present, but much of the positive record is official self-reporting and partner-led. Network corruption and selective accountability remain unresolved constraints.",
